{
  "key": "letter-180-part-01",
  "number": 180,
  "generationId": "01a1e8e7-04a3-76ef-a011-f08d3fce1a74",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-180/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.626757
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Meditation is a mirror - and the most faithful one.",
      "path": "audio/1971-180/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.8690479999999998,
      "end": 4.947506
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Whoever goes into meditation risks a confrontation with himself.",
      "path": "audio/1971-180/03.mp3",
      "start": 6.215125,
      "end": 9.805532999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "The mirror of meditation never lies, and it does not flatter.",
      "path": "audio/1971-180/04.mp3",
      "start": 11.084195000000001,
      "end": 14.717505999999998
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "It is impartial and innocent and it never projects anything.",
      "path": "audio/1971-180/05.mp3",
      "start": 15.980612000000002,
      "end": 19.911451
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "It only faithfully shows your real, original face, the face we never show to the world, the face that we ourselves have forgotten.",
      "path": "audio/1971-180/06.mp3",
      "start": 21.192629999999998,
      "end": 29.852766000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "So it is possible that you yourself may not be able to recognize it the first time!",
      "path": "audio/1971-180/07.mp3",
      "start": 31.141088,
      "end": 35.498163
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "But do not escape from it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-180/08.mp3",
      "start": 36.782925000000006,
      "end": 38.403696
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Face it and you will come to know it and recognize it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-180/09.mp3",
      "start": 39.947188000000004,
      "end": 43.610794
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "This confrontation is the first test of courage on the inner way.",
      "path": "audio/1971-180/10.mp3",
      "start": 45.186395000000005,
      "end": 49.97
    }
  ]
}
